  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "In such questions, we will go by options and use BODMAS\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/6fd114da135bfec237982749959613e604e8bc50dbb65289cb13eb2dc73c3145.png] \n\n**Given equation :- 36 ÷ 6 + 8 − 2 × 5 = −4**\n\nInterchanging the given number by the number in the equation\n\n**Option(1) 36 and 8**\n\n⇒__ **8**÷ 6 __+ **36** − 2 × 5 = −4\n\n⇒ **1.333 **+ 36 -__ 2 × 5 __= - 4\n\n⇒__ 1.333 + 36__ - **10** = - 4\n\n⇒ __**37.333** -10__ = - 4\n\n⇒ **27.333** = - 4(not possible)\n\n⇒** LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**Option(2) 2 and 6**\n\n⇒__36 ÷ **2**__ + 8 − **6** × 5 = −4\n\n⇒**18** + 8 -__ 6 × 5 __= - 4\n\n⇒ __18 + 8__ -** 30** = - 4\n\n⇒__ **26** - 30 __= - 4\n\n⇒** - 4 **= - 4\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS \n\nOption(3) 2 and 8\n\n⇒__ ____36 ÷ 6 __+ **2**− **8 **× 5 = −4\n\n⇒** 6 **+ 2 -__ 8 × 5__ = - 4\n\n⇒__ **6 + 2**__** - 40 = - 4**\n\n**⇒__ 8 - 40__ = - 4**\n\n**⇒ - 32 = - 4 (not possible)**\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option(4) 6 and 8**\n\n⇒ __36 ÷ 8 __+ 6 − 2 × 5 = −4\n\n⇒ 4.5 + 6 -__ 2 × 5__ = - 4\n\n⇒__ 4.5 + 6__ - 10 = - 4\n\n⇒ __10.5 - 10 __= - 4\n\n⇒ 0.5 = - 4 (not possible)\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption (2) satisfies the given equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is option(2)",
